<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Empresas ICA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Empresas ICA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers initiated coverage of Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora SA de CV with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $19 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- said construction market in Mexico will have fierce competition.</p>
<p>-- said has concerns that negotiations between Empresas ICA and the Mexican government on the restructuring of ICA's toll-road investments may result in asset writedowns, which could be substantial.</p>
<p>-- said Empresas ICA is well-managed company with strong capabilities.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
